le_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422647016:0":{"text":"住民と、制度？","source_cn":"人，以及制度？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3187E468BED6700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422647017:1":{"text":"先ほどの二人は、上司と部下でも主と従者でもなく、ただの友人だ。ここでは、私的な問題に公的な法律を持ち出すことはめったにない。","source_cn":"是的，刚才争执的二位只是普通朋友，并非上下级或主仆关系...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5037B813D2AA796F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422647018:1":{"text":"損失が生じたのなら、それ相応の弁済をすればいい。今回は我々がアヒルを連れ戻したので、彼らのわだかまりを解消するだけで済んだ。","source_cn":"如果真的存在损失，那就适当赔偿；但我们已经帮忙挽回损失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB31BDED83891CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422647019:1":{"text":"まあ、仲直りするかどうかは本人たち次第だがな。私はただ、両者に公平な指摘をしただけだ。","source_cn":"本质上，要不要和好是他们之间的事，我只是公平地批评了双方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD75EDD74C14A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1422647019":{"text":"まあ、仲直りするかどうかは本人たち次第だがな。私はただ、両者に公平な指摘をしただけだ。","source_cn":"本质上，要不要和好是他们之间的事，我只是公平地批评了双方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD75EDD74C14A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit